  <section class="block" id="sources">
    <h2>Sources</h2>
    <ol class="src">
      <li><a href="https://doi.org/10.1038/nrmicro3432" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Flores-Mireles AL et al. Urinary tract infections: epidemiology, mechanisms of infection and treatment options. Nat Rev Microbiol 2015</a></li>
